  "source_code": "MOD = 998244353\r\nN = 200005\r\nD = [0 for _ in range(N)]\r\nfor i in range(1,N):\r\n    D[i] = (D[i-1] + pow(i,-1,MOD)) % MOD\r\n\r\nfor _ in range(int(input())):\r\n    n = int(input())\r\n    a = [int(x) for x in input().split()]\r\n    ans = 0\r\n    for i in range(n):\r\n        subans1 = (a[i] * D[i]) % MOD\r\n        subans2 = (a[i] * D[n-i-1]) % MOD\r\n        ans = (ans + subans1 + subans2) % MOD\r\n    print(ans)",
